                            together, after visually validating a printed PDF).
                        </div></div><div class="row mt8"><label string="Report Lines on First Page" for="pt_arxi_lines_first_page"/></div><div class="row mt8"><field name="pt_arxi_lines_first_page" class="oe_inline"/><div class="text-muted">
